{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "c05-title-01",
   "scene": "c05-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter five. When the pronoun for he",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "title",
    "ar:ـهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-title-02",
   "scene": "c05-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "changes its damma to a kasra.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-01",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a kasra, or after this letter,",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "ar:ي#2",
    "hl:After kasra or"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-02",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "the damma of the pronoun for he becomes a kasra.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُ#2",
    "hl:becomes a kasra"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-03",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After this letter: in it, on it, to him.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-04",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِيهِ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فِيهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-05",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلَيْهِ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "ar:عَلَيْهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-06",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "إِلَيْهِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:إِلَيْهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-07",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a kasra: with it, and in his house.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-08",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "بِهِ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "ar:بِهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-09",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي بَيْتِهِ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فِي بَيْتِهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-01",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The same happens to three more pronouns.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-02",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They, two.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُمَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-03",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They, men.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-04",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And they, women.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُنَّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-05",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On them.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "b:1",
    "ex:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-06",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلَيْهِمْ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:عَلَيْهِمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-07",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for they, men,",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "note:0",
    "ar:ـهُمْ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-08",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "comes after this letter,",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ي"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-09",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "so its damma becomes a kasra.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهِمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-10",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In them, two.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-11",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِيهِمَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فِيهِمَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-12",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for they, two,",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "note:1",
    "ar:ـهُمَا#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-13",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "comes after the same letter,",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ي#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-14",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "so it changes in the same way.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهِمَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-15",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In their house, women.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-16",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي بَيْتِهِنَّ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فِي بَيْتِهِنَّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-17",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for house ends in a kasra here. It is jarr after the preposition meaning in.",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": [
    "note:2",
    "ar:بَيْتِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-18",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for they, women, comes after it,",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُنَّ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-ex-19",
   "scene": "c05-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "so its damma becomes a kasra too.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهِنَّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-01",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Tip. It is the same pronoun.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "hl:It is the same pronoun"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-02",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Only the sound changes, to make it easy to say.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:Only the sound changes"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-03",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "With a damma, a fatha or a sukūn before it, it stays as it is.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-04",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a sukūn: from him.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-05",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مِنْهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:مِنْهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-06",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a fatha: for him.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-07",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لَهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:لَهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-08",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a damma: his book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-09",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُهُ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُهُ"
   ]
  }
 ]
}